    "declared_names": [
      "VM view data every typed-array width and DataView expose the physical backing offset",
      "VM view data live empty views retain their exact end pointer",
      "VM view data bypasses getters and rejects forged live and revoked proxy brands",
      "VM view data detached typed and DataView addresses are null while lease acquisition still throws",
      "VM view data fixed resizable views preserve stored offsets while out of bounds and after regrowth",
      "VM view data tracking resizable views keep the address independently of rounded usable length",
      "VM view data shared aliases expose one native address across real runtime growth",
      "VM view data allocates nothing under the actual VM memory limit",
      "VM view data preserves actual ordinary uncatchable and private termination completions",
      "VM view data borrows without keeping the actual view or native backing alive",
      "VM view data observes unmanaged external storage without adding a lease or changing cleanup",
      "VM view data follows real ArrayBuffer transfer detachment and the receiving physical storage"
    ],
